slices scattered on the surface. The background features a lush, green tree with glossy leaves and more white flowers, creating a fresh and natural ambiance. The lighting is soft and diffused, with a bokeh effect in the background, adding a dreamy, serene quality to the image. The glass bottle's transparency allows the green limes and white flowers to be clearly visible through the water. The textures range from the smooth surface of the water to the rough, textured lime slices and the soft petals of the flowers. The overall composition is balanced and aesthetically pleasing, highlighting the freshness and natural beauty of the ingredients."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 39, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 33, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 16}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.4", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-255.132868119123, 111.929231812489], "scale": 0.40909090909091195}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 60, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "wan2.2图像反推文生图——书墨旅人", "bounding": [859.8597412109375, 243.8113250732422, 1338.998046875, 80]}], "links": [[1, 15, 0, 5, 0, "MODEL"], [2, 13, 0, 5, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [3, 18, 0, 5, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [4, 15, 0, 6, 0, "MODEL"], [5, 6, 0, 7, 0, "SIGMAS"], [6, 4, 0, 8, 0, "NOISE"], [7, 5, 0, 8, 1, "GUIDER"], [8, 3, 0, 8, 2, "SAMPLER"], [9, 7, 0, 8, 3, "SIGMAS"], [10, 2, 0, 8, 4, "LATENT"], [11, 9, 0, 10, 0, "NOISE"], [12, 5, 0, 10, 1, "GUIDER"], [13, 3, 0, 10, 2, "SAMPLER"], [14, 7, 1, 10, 3, "SIGMAS"], [15, 8, 0, 10, 4, "LATENT"], [16, 12, 0, 13, 0, "CLIP"], [17, 19, 0, 15, 0, "MODEL"], [18, 10, 0, 16, 0, "LATENT"], [19, 14, 0, 16, 1, "VAE"], [21, 12, 0, 18, 0, "CLIP"], [2